<title>GERMANY: AMV to raise capital in bonus share issue.</title>
<headline>AMV to raise capital in bonus share issue.</headline>
<dateline>AACHEN, Germany 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>German insurer Aachener und Muenchener Versicherung AG (AMV) said on Tuesday it planned to raise capital by 23.37 million marks to 140.22 million marks from reserves by offering bonus shares in a ratio of one for five.</p>
<p>The new shares will be entitled to dividends for the 1997 year, AMV said in a mandatory statement. The capital raising will be proposed to shareholders at the annual general meeting on June 3.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
